### List transactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Create an expense (replace category_id with a real expense category id you created)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

{
  "category_id": 2,
  "amount": 45.50,
  "type": "expense",
  "date": "2026-08-01",
  "note": "Weekly groceries"
}

