### List budgets (defaults to current month/year)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Create a budget (replace category_id with a real EXPENSE category id)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

{
  "category_id": 2,
  "limit_amount": 10000,
  "month": 8,
  "year": 2026
}

### Try creating the SAME budget again — should get 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

{
  "category_id": 2,
  "limit_amount": 10000,
  "month": 8,
  "year": 2026
}

### Comparison (current vs previous month)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/analytics/comparison
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Trends (default: last 6 months)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/analytics/trends
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

### Trends with a custom date range
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/analytics/trends?start_date=2026-06-01&end_date=2026-08-31
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

